SUMMARY:The Moon occults Venus
DESCRIPTION:Venus disappears at 14:00:29 and reappears at 15:08:12 EAT\, se
 en from Mogadishu\, SO.\nThe Moon is 71° up in the SSE · daylight\, Sun 
 +58°.\nTimes for the Moon's mean limb\, ±2 s.\nMap\, timings and the vie
 w at the Moon's edge: https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?lat=2.0371
 &lon=45.3438
URL:https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?lat=2.0371&lon=45.3438
